# KIPPER: damage done to a big one stays only once the sub docks; run dry
# first and it's lost. Beaten, it flees for good at once, its deep light
# counts (two lights, a third slot) and the game is saved; Gnasher's flight
# earns the beacon goal.
seed 1
game kipper
wait 5
cheat newgame
cheat clear
cheat calm
expect boss0_hp == 500
cheat hurtboss 0 100
expect boss0_hp == 400
cheat dock 0
expect boss0_banked == 400
wait 25
press A
wait 5
press B
wait 5
cheat hurtboss 0 100
expect boss0_hp == 300
cheat dry
wait 160
expect boss0_hp == 400
press B
wait 5
cheat killboss 0
wait 110
expect boss0_dead == 1
expect boss0_on == 0
expect lights == 1
expect goals & 1
cheat killboss 1
wait 110
expect lights == 2
expect slots == 3
cheat dry
wait 160
expect boss0_dead == 1
expect lights == 2
